    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d72">

                <pb facs="0186" n="80" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg80"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Wharton to Mr.
                            Pacheco</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-09-04"><hi rendition="#italic">September 4,
                        1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Wharton inquires as to the length of time for which, under the contract, the
                    Salvadorian Government claims it can detain the <hi rendition="#italic">City of
                        Panama</hi> and asks the meaning of the offer of indemnity for unlawful
                    detention if the vessel is not to be detained longer than the contract
                    permits.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
